The airplane is in Copenhagen now.
It is January.
I am very excited.
I pack my book into my bag.
There is a passenger next to me.
He looks at me and smiles.
"Hello," he says.
"Hello," I say.
"What is your name?" he asks.
"My name is Maya," I say.
"Where do you come from, Maya?" he asks.
I smile happily.
"I come from Mexico," I answer.
"Are you from Copenhagen?" I ask.
"Yes, I am from Denmark," he says.
"Welcome to Denmark," he says.
"Thank you very much," I say.
Now we are here.
I am ready.
